namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIDesignerSettings {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/DreamWidgetBlueprintEditor.cpp#DreamUIDesignerSettings
    src   "How this author's designer behaves, as opposed to what the asset is. Grid snapping, the grid size\nand the overlays are preferences: kept on the asset they dirtied assets whose content nobody had\ntouched, and travelled to teammates in the diff; kept in DefaultEditor.ini they were still one\nshared project-wide value. Per-project-per-user is the same home UMG's designer uses. The canvas\nsize and the lock set stay on the asset, because those describe the hierarchy itself."
    text  "说明此作者的设计器如何运作，而非资产本身是什么。网格吸附、网格大小\n和叠加层属于偏好设置：保存在资产上会弄脏内容无人改动过的资产，\n并在差异中传给团队成员；保存在DefaultEditor.ini中则仍是项目范围内\n共享的单一值。按项目、按用户正是UMG设计器所使用的存放位置。画布\n大小和锁定集合留在资产上，因为它们描述的是层级本身。"
    state machine
}

