    src   "Snap designer moves and resizes to GridSize."
    text  "使设计器中的移动和缩放吸附到GridSize。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDesignerSettings:bPreviewDPIScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/DreamWidgetBlueprintEditor.cpp#DreamUIDesignerSettings:bPreviewDPIScale
    src   "Shrink the design canvas by the project's DPI curve, the way UMG's designer does.\n\nUUserInterfaceSettings::GetDPIScaleBasedOnSize turns a device resolution into the application\nscale Slate will apply, and a widget authored without it is authored at a size no device shows.\nOff by default because DreamCanvas has a scaler of its own: with both on, the canvas previews\nthe device scale AND the canvas rule, which is what actually happens at runtime."
    text  "按项目的DPI曲线缩小设计画布，与UMG设计器的做法相同。\n\nUUserInterfaceSettings::GetDPIScaleBasedOnSize会把设备分辨率转换为Slate\n将应用的应用程序缩放比例，未按此创作的控件，其创作尺寸在任何设备上\n都不会显示。默认关闭，因为DreamCanvas有自己的缩放器：两者同时开启时，\n画布会同时预览设备缩放和画布规则，而这才是运行时实际发生的情况。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDesignerSettings:bRealtimeViewport {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/DreamWidgetBlueprintEditor.cpp#DreamUIDesignerSettings:bRealtimeViewport
    src   "Redraw the design viewport on every frame.\n\nOff, it redraws when the designer has something new to show -- a gesture, the pointer moving over\nit, a selection, a rebuild -- and otherwise four times a second, so an open designer nobody is\ntouching stops rendering its scene at the editor's frame rate. Animations and tweens playing in the\npreview are drawn at that slower rate while it is off."
    text  "每帧重绘设计视口。\n\n关闭时，仅当设计器有新内容需要显示时才重绘——一次手势、指针在其上\n移动、一次选择、一次重建——其余时间每秒重绘四次，因此无人操作的\n设计器不再以编辑器的帧率渲染其场景。关闭期间，预览中播放的动画和\n补间也会以这一较慢的速率绘制。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDesignerSettings:bRespectDesignerLocks {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/DreamWidgetBlueprintEditor.cpp#DreamUIDesignerSettings:bRespectDesignerLocks
    src   "Honour the designer locks recorded on the asset. Turning it off reaches a locked background\nfor one edit without unlocking it, which is the only way back from a lock that would otherwise\nhave to be undone and redone. The locks themselves are untouched: this decides who reads them."
    text  "遵循记录在资产上的设计器锁定。关闭此项后，可在不解锁的情况下对\n锁定的背景进行一次编辑，这是从锁定状态回退的唯一方式，否则只能\n先撤销再重做。锁定本身不受影响：此项决定由谁读取它们。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDesignerSettings:bShowClipMasks {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/DreamWidgetBlueprintEditor.cpp#DreamUIDesignerSettings:bShowClipMasks
    src   "Outline the clip mask of each selected widget that has one: its shape where it cuts, in the clip's own frame."
    text  "为每个具有裁剪遮罩的选中控件勾勒其裁剪遮罩：在裁剪自身的坐标系中绘制其裁剪处的形状。"
    state machine
}

