DreamUIDesignerSettings:bShowSafeZone {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/DreamWidgetBlueprintEditor.cpp#DreamUIDesignerSettings:bShowSafeZone
    src   "Draw the platform's title-safe area on the design canvas.\n\nIts own switch, not a rider on the resolution guides. The two answer different questions -- \"how\ndoes this look on a phone\" and \"will the TV crop my HUD\" -- and tying the safe area to the\nresolution overlay meant the only way to see it was to also draw six device rectangles over the\nscreen being designed."
    text  "在设计画布上绘制平台的标题安全区。\n\n它是独立的开关，不依附于分辨率参考线。两者回答的是不同的问题——“如何\n在手机上显示”和“电视会不会裁掉我的HUD”——而把安全区绑到\n分辨率叠加层上，就意味着要想看到它，只能同时在被设计的屏幕上\n画出六个设备矩形。"
    state machine
}

